			<section class="book-page" id="page-72">
				<div class="page-body-content">
					<div class="page-running-head">
						<span class="chapter-header-label">Chapter 12: Starving the Fire</span>
						<span class="page-count-label">Page 72</span>
					</div>

					<div class="chapter-content">
						<p>Use Only: Pure mineral salts (Redmond Real Salt, Celtic sea salt) and pure&nbsp;black&nbsp;pepper.</p>
						<p>Sweeteners: If an absolute craving hits, use only 100% pure stevia extract powder or drops. You must verify that it contains zero bulking agents like maltodextrin or erythritol, which can alter osmotic pressure or feed&nbsp;bacterial&nbsp;fermentation.</p>
						<h3>The Core&nbsp;Mindset</h3>
						<p>Do not mistake this elimination baseline for a permanent nutritional philosophy or an&nbsp;ideological&nbsp;lifestyle.</p>
						<p>It is a diagnostic and therapeutic reset tool. It proves that your pain is driven by real, measurable chemical inputs, gives your frayed mucosal tissues an environment of continuous rest, and establishes the quiet baseline you need to methodically inspect and repair your&nbsp;dental&nbsp;hardware.</p>

