						<p>Gluma Desensitizer: A liquid formulation combining glutaraldehyde and HEMA&nbsp;(hydroxyethyl&nbsp;methacrylate).</p>
						<p>When applied to bare dentin, glutaraldehyde causes the proteins dissolved in dentinal fluid to coagulate and precipitate, forming a biological seal up to 200 microns deep inside&nbsp;the&nbsp;tubules.</p>
						<p>Light-Cured Unfilled Resin Glazes: Products like Seal and Protect or Tokuyama Shield Force Plus form a micro-thin, cured polymer film directly over exposed root collars, sealing thousands of open pipes without leaving bulky plastic margins that irritate&nbsp;the&nbsp;gums.</p>
